= Overrun

A total, and absolute disaster. There is no other way to describe it.

Be it through subversion, or through our own failures, or through electoral spoilance, or whathaveyou, the KPD has - somehow - secured a total victory over us, the republicans, and the reactionaries. Already the Reichswehr has attempted to mobilize in turn against this government, but the KPD managed to miraculously secure victory here as well, with Thalmann completely dismantling the Reichswehr and replacing it with the RFB.

Many prominent faces of the SPD have either been arrested or now live in exile in neighboring states. An outpour of migrants has also begun along the border territories, with many describing the new state enacting mass purges in the style of Stalin's Union. Diplomatically, Germany has again become a pariah in Europe, only supported by the Soviet Union, while the other European democracies hold their breaths in horror.

Only one thing is for certain; the path Germany will take will define the next century

- @game_over: Game over.